      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1950949575574929418",
      "text": "[4:56PM] #Ajegunle #Apapa #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is flowing smoothly from Ojo Road and Otto Wharf through to Boundary.\nHowever, vehicular movement around Boundary Roundabout is slow due to closing-hour congestion and commercial activities, though traffic is still moving.\nMobil Road, both inbound and outbound, is experiencing free-flowing traffic.\n\nTraffic movement out of Apapa, from Point Road to Iganmu via Marine Bridge, is also smooth.\nConversely, the movement of flatbed trucks from High Bridge to the port is slow and uncoordinated. As a result, flatbeds unable to access port facilities are being restricted to a single lane to ensure free movement for other vehicles on the second lane.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
