      "text": "[6:50PM] #Iju_Ishaga #TrafficUpdate \n\nFagba is a little bit busy for now due high influx, Jonathan Coker is good down to Amala both inward and outward.\n\nThe stretch of Iju Road down to Agege Peñ Cinema is good, but slow underneath the bridge.\n\nCollege road is very good down to Yaya Abatan, while it's slightly busy inward Ajayi from Excellence Hotel roundabout.\n\nNationwide back to Jungle is good, enroute Fagba is good down to AP filling station.\n\nSmooth movement from Fagba down to Ishaga roundabt, inward Toyin is slightly busy.\n\nJourney back to Fagba from Ishaga is faster inw Kitso School Fagba, slow back to Fagba intersection for now.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
